      "name": "Ayan Kar",
      "created_at": "2025-07-25T13:56:52.676Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After installing the India Compliance app and entering the GSTIN/UIN in the company details, the status is showing as “Not Available.” Additionally, when attempting to create an invoice using the GST item tax template provided by the app, an error appears stating:<br>\n“Company GSTIN is a mandatory field for GST Transactions.”</p>\n<p>Could you please assist in resolving this issue?</p>",
