      "id": 475394,
      "username": "Smit_Vora",
      "name": "Smit Vora",
      "created_at": "2025-07-26T12:11:45.644Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>Is GSTIN set in the company address? If not it may raise the said error.</li>\n<li>GST Status refresh consumes API, and may have been disabled in your GST settings, hence you are seeing status as Not Available.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/1?ui=2&amp;ik=76838f8dd1&amp;attid=0.1&amp;permmsgid=msg-a:r-8622288599476648551&amp;th=1984575edd3f9f9c&amp;view=fimg&amp;fur=ip&amp;permmsgid=msg-a:r-8622288599476648551&amp;sz=s0-l75-ft&amp;attbid=ANGjdJ-VvDOwZ4wOsXHKHMDiPDngncIm_Ht6H5ksmarp-P6rorCzVlBIPLp-m3hhbKCL5KzXnNV19JYA21YcCxrOppmHfEiPnSCdpA7nE2LKwCxyniX6lPjf3c9G2k8&amp;disp=emb&amp;realattid=ii_mdjvrstq0&amp;zw\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"524\" height=\"215\"></p>",
